    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Ball</strong> is a fast-paced futuristic sports game set in a vibrant cyberpunk world. As the manager of a high-tech team, you\u2019re in control of every strategic decision\u2014draft top players, hire expert coaches, and make bold trades to build a championship-winning squad. But the action doesn\u2019t stop there. Take the field yourself to play intense, high-octane matches, combining skill, speed, and strategy as you outmaneuver opponents in the arena. Will your team dominate the neon-lit stadiums and rise to the top in this futuristic sport? The future of the game is in your hands.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Ball</strong> is a fast-paced futuristic sports game set in a vibrant cyberpunk world. As the manager of a high-tech team, you\u2019re in control of every strategic decision\u2014draft top players, hire expert coaches, and make bold trades to build a championship-winning squad. But the action doesn\u2019t stop there. Take the field yourself to play intense, high-octane matches, combining skill, speed, and strategy as you outmaneuver opponents in the arena. Will your team dominate the neon-lit stadiums and rise to the top in this futuristic sport? The future of the game is in your hands.</p>",
